      "content": "but the pediatrician's office is closed till monday and it's the weekend so i can't get through to anyone. he's still acting pretty normal though, just a bit cranky. do you think it could just be a heat rash or like a common virus that's acting up? seems like a lot of fuss for just some spots.",
